description = "Cut with both blades for {hit} Physical damage. From farther than your weapon reaches (up to {a:cut.range} m) you throw a dagger instead: {d:CUT_THROWN} Physical damage, and it becomes a stuck dagger. Builds Flow. In a Kill window it becomes {n:gut}."
